- `crates/vox-cli/src/commands/ci/mod.rs`: Declared the new `no_plugin_cdylib_as_compile_dep` module.
- `crates/vox-cli/src/commands/ci/run_body.rs`: Integrated the `no_plugin_cdylib_as_compile_dep::check` function into the `run` function for the `CiCmd::NoPluginCdylibAsCompileDep` variant.

